<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Commonwealth Bank cuts home loan rate.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Commonwealth Bank cuts home loan rate.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Bank of Australia said on Friday it would cut its Economiser Base variable home loan rate by 0.15 percentage point to 7.85 percent.</p>
<p>The bank said the rate is available for new borrowers from November 18 and for existing borrowers from December 30.  </p>
<p>Commonwealth Bank general manager, personal banking, Alf Long said in a statement that the bank had lifted its share of home loan lending to 25.98 percent in September, up 12 percent over the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
